>## Apply a parser containing a function to a parser containing a value
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
>term apply = λpf,pa.let parse := λinput.cases(parsing.ParseResult){success=λsf.cases(parsing.ParseResult){success=λsa.parsing.ParseResult{success = parsing.ParseSuccess{value = parsing.ParseSuccess[value] sf (parsing.ParseSuccess[value] sa), remainder = parsing.ParseSuccess[remainder] sa}}, failure=λe.parsing.ParseResult{failure = e}} (parsing.Parser[] pa (parsing.ParseSuccess[remainder] sf)), failure=λe.parsing.ParseResult{failure = e}} (parsing.Parser[] pf input) in wrap(parsing.Parser){parse}
