>## Parse something between an opening and closing parser
#^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
#  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ source.hydra comment.block.documentation.hydra
